1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,505
In September 1933, ten men broke out of

2
00:00:03,515 --> 00:00:05,979
the Indiana State Prison in Michigan City.

3
00:00:06,209 --> 00:00:07,774
The guns had been smuggled in.

4
00:00:08,175 --> 00:00:10,548
John Dillinger, paroled from that prison

5
00:00:10,558 --> 00:00:13,234
in May, helped plan it, and had pistols

6
00:00:13,244 --> 00:00:15,474
hidden in a shipment to the prison's shirt

7
00:00:15,484 --> 00:00:15,753
shop.

8
00:00:16,153 --> 00:00:18,355
By then, Dillinger was locked up again

9
00:00:18,365 --> 00:00:21,291
himself, arrested in Dayton, Ohio, four

10
00:00:21,301 --> 00:00:22,004
days earlier.

11
00:00:22,404 --> 00:00:25,247
On September 26, the ten forced their way

12
00:00:25,257 --> 00:00:27,572
out at gunpoint, shooting a prison clerk.

13
00:00:27,802 --> 00:00:30,034
They took a visiting sheriff hostage and

14
00:00:30,044 --> 00:00:31,495
fled in commandeered cars.

15
00:00:31,895 --> 00:00:34,419
Two weeks later, three of them walked into

16
00:00:34,429 --> 00:00:37,394
the jail in Lima, Ohio, posing as Indiana

17
00:00:37,404 --> 00:00:39,176
officers, and freed Dillinger.

18
00:00:39,406 --> 00:00:41,572
Sheriff Jess Sarber was shot, and died

19
00:00:41,582 --> 00:00:42,108
that night.

20
00:00:42,508 --> 00:00:44,130
The gang lasted less than a year.

21
00:00:44,360 --> 00:00:46,893
Federal agents killed Dillinger in Chicago

22
00:00:46,903 --> 00:00:50,098
in July 1934, and Harry Pierpont was

23
00:00:50,108 --> 00:00:51,575
executed that October.

24
00:00:51,975 --> 00:00:53,934
The prison in Michigan City, near the

25
00:00:53,944 --> 00:00:57,037
lakefront, dates to 1860, and it still

26
00:00:57,047 --> 00:00:59,428
holds inmates today, so view it from the

27
00:00:59,438 --> 00:00:59,685
road.

28
00:01:00,185 --> 00:01:02,228
Comment your town, and it could be next.

